      "date": "2026-03-25T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Hamps Bio Limited (BSE:544312) completed the acquisition of HSDL Innovative Private Limited.",
      "body": "Hamps Bio Limited (BSE:544312) agreed to acquire HSDL Innovative Private Limited for INR 20.4 million on February 14, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 20.4 million will be paid by Hamps Bio Limited. As part of consideration, INR 20.4 million is paid towards common equity of HSDL Innovative Private Limited.\r\n\r\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, HSDL Innovative Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 18.66 million.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval of offer by Hamps Bio Limited board. The deal has been approved by the board. The acquisition is expected to be completed within sixty days.\r\n\n\nHamps Bio Limited (BSE:544312) completed the acquisition of HSDL Innovative Private Limited on March 25, 2026.",
